<title>USA: Clinton formally announces Christopher resignation.</title>
<headline>Clinton formally announces Christopher resignation.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Bill Clinton announced on Thursday that he has accepted Secretary of State Warren Christopher's resignation &quot;with great regret.&quot; Christopher told reporters he would leave on January 20 when Clinton is inaugurated for a second term.</p>
</text>
